<title>USA: SAN ANTONIO FEEDER CATTLE STEADY-FIRM - USDA.</title>
<headline>SAN ANTONIO FEEDER CATTLE STEADY-FIRM - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Feeder steers and heifers steady to firm, compared to last week, USDA said. Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 10 percent cows and bulls, 14 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs. Receipts - 913    Last Week - 842    Last Year - 2,509</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 71.50- 79.50; 700-800 lbs 71.00-76.00; few 800-900 lbs 69.25-74.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-800 lbs 67.50-74.50; few 800-950 lbs 63.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 69.50-74.00; few 700-800 lbs 67.50-77.00, pkg replacements 94.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - few 500-550 lbs 71.00-72.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
